"博麗霊夢","id":"76694D22-B5B0-49C3-B48E-54132F567900","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_dace56b32e\/元女子校の日常　第9話_dace56b32e.102.jpeg","slideTitle":"スライド #102","backgroundName":"nc256639_警察署（夜）.jpg","voiceDuration":5.159478458049887,"title":"シーン 102"},{"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","duration":2.5,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","seStartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_103_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","seVolume":1,"telop":"「ええ…」","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc256639_警察署（夜）.jpg","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","id":"41CAF5C6-D03A-41E6-9185-3B14BB77381D","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_dace56b32e\/元女子校の日常　第9話_dace56b32e.103.jpeg","slideTitle":"スライド #103","backgroundName":"nc256639_警察署（夜）.jpg","voiceDuration":1.5,"title":"シーン 103"},{"transitionName":"なし","seStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3,"characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","seVolume":1,"telop":"二人が家に着くと…","id":"634D2707-CEC5-495D-A7DC-FD252EE09345","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_dace56b32e\/元女子校の日常　第9話_dace56b32e.104.jpeg","slideTitle":"スライド #104","backgroundName":"単色背景","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 104: 二人が家に着くと…"},{"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","duration":10.668231292517007,"audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_105_博麗霊夢.wav","seVolume":1,"telop":"私たちが、家に着くと、どことなく違和感が漂う。そして、ふと冷蔵庫を開けてみると、見知らぬワインがあった。「まさか…」","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","id":"C3B42520-B5BD-4920-A80C-5CD2D26FD5E3","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_dace56b32e\/元女子校の日常　第9話_dace56b32e.105.jpeg","slideTitle":"スライド #105","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","voiceDuration":10.068231292517007,"title":"シーン 105"},{"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","duration":9.904489795918368,"audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）叡智シーンのみ\/後ろ手すやすや頬照り寝顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_106_博麗霊夢.wav","seVolume":1,"telop":"そして、そっと息子の部屋の扉を開けて、中を覗く。すると、彼女が言っていた女性が、スヤスヤとベッドで寝ていた。","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","id":"9ECCA3CA-43B3-4719-AB5B-501A22CCACDD","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_dace56b32e\/元女子校の日常　第9話_dace56b32e.106.jpeg","slideTitle":"スライド #106","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（夜・照明OFF）.jpg","voiceDuration":9.304489795918368,"title":"シーン 106"},{"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","duration":11.369478458049887,"audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_107_博麗霊夢.wav","seVolume":1,"telop":"そして、私と彼の部屋に入ると、紅夢がベッドの片方で寝ていた。私は、それを確認すると、リビングで待つ彼女の元に戻る。","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","id":"5CBABD27-1E1B-47B5-B162-C2A6C7BA9AED","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_dace56b32e\/元女子校の日常　第9話_dace56b32e.107.jpeg","slideTitle":"スライド #107","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":10.769478458049887,"title":"シーン 107"},{"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","duration":3.1609070294784583,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","seStartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_108_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","seVolume":1,"telop":"「それで、各部屋の様子はどうでしたか？」","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","id":"9402068E-9CEB-43F0-9AF5-B79E126B558E","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_dace56b32e\/元女子校の日常　第9話_dace56b32e.108.jpeg","slideTitle":"スライド #108","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","voiceDuration":2.560907029478458,"title":"シーン 108"},{"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","duration":9.345238095238095,"audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_109_博麗霊夢.wav","seVolume":1,"telop":"「あなたに指摘された通りです。それで…本当に私の息子の許嫁に妹さんをもらって大丈夫でしょうか？」","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","id":"E3E2F5CD-7C30-464E-AD6D-22A80AD03362","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_dace56b32e\/元女子校の日常　第9話_dace56b32e.109.jpeg","slideTitle":"スライド #109","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.745238095238095,"title":"シーン 109"},{"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","duration":3.2713151927437645,"audioTrack":"tra